  "description": "## Problem\r\n\r\nThe `dtolnay/rust-toolchain` action is not verified on GitHub, which violates IBM's security requirements for GitHub Actions workflows.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nReplace all instances of `dtolnay/rust-toolchain` with the verified `actions-rust-lang/setup-rust-toolchain@v1` action throughout the Rust plugins CI/CD workflow.",
